                        "entry_id": "32fc481d-176a-3cbd-8d24-768348aa6b5c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The system where a tenant farmer, especially in the southern United States, farms the land in exchange for a portion of the crops."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
